OL,5,G0300 Inside Hampton Court Palace
OL,6,     FHead gardener Graham Dillamore and
OL,7,     Fhis team are hard at work in the
OL,8,     Fgrounds preparing 120,000 bulbs
OL,9,     Ffor what should be the biggest
OL,10,     Ftulip festival in Britain.
OL,11,G0345 Inside Hampton Court Palace
OL,12,     FGet up close and personal with the
OL,13,     Fpalace warders as they take us
OL,14,     Finto the huge kitchens and secret
OL,15,     Fnooks. The staff are preparing for
OL,16,     Fthe biggest memorial the palace
OL,17,     Fhas ever seen.
